#N canvas 40 40 1300 1000 12;
#X text 20 5 [atom-sq-display] - the SQ screen \, one layout on every page: top line = labels for screen buttons 1-3 \, then knobs 1-3 with values \, middle = status (page and play state \, instrument speed octave) \, then knobs 4-6 \, bottom line = screen buttons 4-6 (6 = the PULSAR mark). pop-ups (the last key \, CLAIR DE LUNE \, KEYS:C5 ...) show on the second status line for 1.2 s. the MUSIC page shows the L / R meters and the level on knob fields 4-6. loaded by atom-sq-map;
